OL,3,GNEWSAUnderground ordeal for rescued
OL,4,APeak District sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stricken sheep stuck in a crack in a
OL,7,Frock in the Peak District had to be
OL,8,Fhoisted back to the surface.
OL,10,FA member of the public discovered the
OL,11,Fsheep trapped out of view inside a
OL,12,Fcrevice near Castleton on Thursday and
OL,13,Fraised the alarm.
OL,15,FThree team members from Derbyshire Cave
OL,16,FRescue Organisation located the animal
OL,17,Fby following the bleating noises and
OL,18,Fused a rope and harness to hoist the
OL,19,Fsheep to safety.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
