OL,3,GNEWSAUnderground ordeal for rescued
OL,4,APeak District sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "It seemed totally
OL,7,Funharmed by its underground adventure,
OL,8,Fother than being a bit muddier than its
OL,9,Ffield companions, and soon wandered off
OL,10,Fto graze."
